ght: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;height: 411.214815px !important;background-size: 16px auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;height: 419.363889px !important;background-size: 16px auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7S0n5Q6QGTxOt7fcwvWhXybN8TpxQTsWIqk4txDp2XgxFEq4cQia7QoMrwoYNLTxCx8bYzLlaCFjxA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;height: 902.666667px !important;background-size: 16px auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 12px;\">\n          帕斯科Pasco区域在上图没有色块标识，它就在绿色的Huanaco区域下面，而Villa Rica是在Pasco的背面正好与Huanaco难免接壤；图片来源CAFE IMPORTS网站\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n           关于维拉瑞卡区域与卢雅雅库合作社\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          维拉瑞卡位于秘鲁的中部，帕斯科大区的北边，与另外一个咖啡产区Huanuco接壤，所以这里的咖啡也与Huanuco的咖啡很相似，比如说我们曾经受买过的来自\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n          Chanchamayo区域的豆子就紧邻着Villa Rica；\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/Gr457cyFia7QojpzxmnFh6xTia13AGVASibzbHMEqGSwS5khKUIe6VViaNC1fOibzOd6mtaBIktmH50rtW6MWWgWwWg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n           Villa Rica的居民\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n           是已经这里定居了数千年的\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n           亚历山人 Yanesha原著名以及来\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n           自安第斯山脈的人和\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n           20世纪从欧洲移民过来\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n           工作的人。他们了解咖啡，当地90%的人口从事咖啡行业，加上这里拥有大面积的丰富生态保育林，也是鸟类的保护区，由于他们对于环境保护和社会责任承诺的重视，这些文化共同将该地区建成了国际著名的有机咖啡产区；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QojpzxmnFh6xTia13AGVASibuIx8M0nzGGmRmHpE1hhUkzYYialJkaJJTz7gml32Pf1uvVF6p0VMn6w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n          这里的咖啡普遍种植在1500-1900米之间的海拔区域，年均温度20摄氏度左右，年降雨量1800毫米，多采取遮荫和堆肥的栽种方式，这里的咖啡大多拥有公平贸易，雨林认证和有机认证；\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QojpzxmnFh6xTia13AGVASibT72Tz37IsK0uB3nv9HRQicKzGk6xXIlMgZCbusIN42qlJaSzxJ8NicvA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;text-decoration: none;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n           卢雅雅库\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;\">\n          Ruya Yacu 合作社就在这里，由230个小农组成，种植咖啡的历史超过30年；合作社根据所交咖啡豆的瑕疵多寡给予不同的奖励，这样的生产和销售机制，能激励咖农关注生产的品质从而为大家创造更好的收益；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);height: 187.85px !important;background-size: 16px auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
